s workload that executes parallel DDLs (one per database) alongside concurrent DMLs (inserts, updates, deletes).\n\nKeyspace name is **_postgres_3_**\n```\nQuery: ALTER TABLE postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583 DROP COLUMN col_postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583_6593260_8473610\n\nERROR: Column for deletion not found \n```\n\nJust 3–4 seconds before the above error, the following was encountered on the same table (although the index was on a different column):\n\n```\n2025-05-24 04:16:19,007 \nQuery : CREATE INDEX NONCONCURRENTLY postgres_3_index_postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583_2626343_3055080 ON postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583 (k, v1)\n\nERROR: Invalid column number 37 \n```\n\n\nIn the transaction where we saw ERROR: Column for deletion not found, the following queries were executed\n\nKeyspace name is postgres_3\n\n```\nbegin;\n\n2025-05-24 04:16:23,341 \n\nQUERY:\n CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW postgres_3_matview_postgres_3_tb_5172672_9937556_4730910_1350696 AS SELECT k, v1, v2, v3, v4, v5, v6, v7, v8, v9, v10, v11, v12, v13, v14, v15, v16, v17, v18, v19, v20, v21, v22, v23, v24, v25, v26, v27, v28, v29, v30, v31, v32, v33, v34, v35 FROM postgres_3_tb_5172672_9937556 \n\n(Note: This is different table) -------^\n\n\n2025-05-24 04:16:23,937\nQUERY:\nALTER TABLE postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583 ALTER COLUMN col_postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583_6593260_8473610 TYPE TEXT USING col_postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583_6593260_8473610::TEXT  \n(Note: This is same table) -------^\n\n\n2025-05-24 04:16:24,297 \nQUERY:\nALTER TABLE postgres_3_tb_8030613_8572862 ALTER COLUMN col_postgres_3_tb_8030613_8572862_9386299_2039083 TYPE DOUBLE PRECISION USING col_postgres_3_tb_8030613_8572862_9386299_2039083::DOUBLE PRECISION\n\n(Note: This is different table) -------^\n\n\n2025-05-24 04:16:25,285 \nQUERY:\nALTER TABLE postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583 DROP COLUMN col_postgres_3_tb_3149971_7607583_6593260_8473610 Query DDL TypeREMOVE_COLUMN\n\nERROR: Column for deletion not found\n\n```\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\